title: "PowerCodeBench"
abstract: "An execution-validated benchmark for LLM-based power-system code generation: 2,000 frozen tasks pairing natural-language operator queries with executable pandapower code and a numerical ground-truth scalar."
type: dataset
version: "1.0.0"
# Version 1.0.0 is the frozen 2,000-task release; benchmark.json has not
# changed since the task freeze. The version number tracks the benchmark
# release, while date-released tracks the artifact snapshot, which also
# carries the later audit, transfer and serving evidence. ARTIFACT_INDEX.md
# maps the reported claims to the frozen evidence and generating scripts.
